TITLE: Corpus failure progress and unavailable sweep evidence

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: FRONTEND-CORPUS-FAILURE-PROGRESS-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Stop a failed operation without losing its missing coordinates
STATEMENT: >>>
After the first initialization, engine or transport failure in one requested
operation, the offline qualification coordinator shall launch no more points of
that operation. It shall retain the first failure, record every remaining point
as unattempted_after_operation_failure and mark the operation unsuccessful.
Later requested operations and later original decks shall still receive their
own attempt subject to the existing admission deadline. Unattempted points shall
never contribute passing execution or numerical agreement evidence.
<<<
